            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Mindcrack 0.152.0</h2>
<p>6 Änderungen seit der letzten Fassung.</p>
<ul>
<li>Remove the flowchart mode from the backlog</li>
<li>Show the signed-in account on the plan card</li>
<li>Report failed actions as an error toast instead of a dialog</li>
<li>Keep toasts in the window corner while a sheet is open</li>
<li>Announce error toasts to VoiceOver</li>
<li>Fassung 0.152.0</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
